  "youtube_title": "The 100-Year-Old Payday Rule You're Doing Backwards 💵",
  "short": "Most people: get paid → spend → save what's left (usually nothing). 💵\n\nThe Richest Man in Babylon (1926) flips it: pay yourself first. Save at least a tenth of what you earn, then spend the rest.\n\nExample: $3,000/month take-home pay → $300 on payday → $3,600 in a year (before any interest).\n\n💬 Be honest: do you save first or last?\n\n#payyourselffirst #richestmaninbabylon #savingmoney #money #personalfinance #moneytips #lobelessons",
